      "message": "In api_kotlin_enum.kt, we successfully apply the experimental annotation if the entire Enum is experimental. However, it is very common in WebGPU to add an experimental value to a stable enum (like a new experimental TextureFormat or FeatureName). Because we are not applying kotlin_member_optin to the individual public const val generations inside the companion object, developers could pass an experimental enum constant to a function without the Kotlin compiler ever issuing an opt-in warning. We should wrap the const val generation with the member opt-in check",
